{
  "id": "ss.char.tri",
  "name": "Tri",
  "description": "The spitter: a ranger of the brood, lean and hooded. A deep teal hood shadows the far half of the face and leaves one narrowed eye and a wry mouth; under the jaw hangs the thing that makes Tri what it is — a gland, full, glossy bile-yellow, the spitting organ the hive gave it and the one organ on any survivor still doing its job. A leather jerkin over a dark shirt, a bandolier of three bile vials across the chest, an aqua scarf wound at the neck and streaming behind, the thinnest limbs of the eight in plain bracers and hose. The dead feelers rise from the crown of the hood and lie back along it. Same dead organ as the rest, set in the jerkin. The wedge it used to be is the hood's point now. Drawn facing +x; the game flips it.",
